	(text "C3: supercap on U1 BAT (XIAO charger, SGM40567-4.2 per forum reports - UNVERIFIED, charges it to 4.2 V). Hold-up for a clean shutdown (NVS save) on mains loss; U2 has no supply then. Use a 5.5 V EDLC, ESR low (see README).\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 148.59 194.31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "32a451c3-3b41-49ec-a137-e370f59aae7f")
	)
	(text "gw - ESP32 multiprotocol Matter gateway : two XIAO modules, hand-wired, one 3D-printed enclosure (DRAFT v0.2, bootstrap by script - NO PCB)\nU1 host  : XIAO ESP32-S3 - Wi-Fi/BLE, esp-matter bridge, BME680/BSEC, USB-C = the only power input. NOTE: S3 *Plus* symbol not in the Seeed library; plain S3 used as placeholder.\nU2 radio : XIAO ESP32-C6 - 802.15.4 RCP only (Wi-Fi/BLE off). Antenna: external U.FL via the module's RF switch (GPIO3 LOW, then GPIO14 HIGH - set in the RCP firmware).\nInter-chip UART (4 wires + GND): S3 D6/TX->C6 D7/RX, C6 D6/TX->S3 D7/RX, S3 D2/RTS->C6 D3/CTS, C6 D2/RTS->S3 D3/CTS  (D6/D7 = default console UART0 pins; console stays on native USB).\nReset/boot of the C6 from the S3: S3 D0 -> R3 -> C6 CHIP_EN, S3 D1 -> R4 -> C6 BOOT (S3 drives them open-drain; series 1k protects against contention).\nPower: USB-C of U1 -> U1 5V pad -> wire -> U2 5V pad (net +5V). Each XIAO has its own 3V3 regulator; C6 3V3 pads are deliberately NOT tied to the S3 3V3. C1/C2 sit at the C6 end of the 5V wire.\n !! Never plug USB into U2 while U1 is powered (two 5 V sources on one net) unless a series Schottky is added in the U1->U2 5V wire - see hardware/kicad/README.md.\nBME680: 4 soldered wires J2 (3V3, GND, SDA, SCL) to a remote sensor pocket; CS->3V3 and SDO->GND (I2C 0x76) straps made on the sensor module. Pull-ups R1/R2 4k7 to 3V3 (omit if the module already has them).\nParts: TME / Mouser / Farnell only - fields Manufacturer, MPN, TME, Mouser, Farnell on every part (mostly still empty, see hardware/kicad/README.md).\nUnverified: pin functions come from the Seeed KiCad library; strapping-pin use (S3 GPIO3 = D2 = RTS; C6 GPIO2/GPIO21) still to be checked in the datasheets."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 245 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "349fc974-3f1e-4877-a9ae-3b1550f7a1ba")
	)
